Fundamental topics - 
a)Linked Service - A linked service defines the connection to a data source or an application(ADF) 
Source(sql) [Souce to ADF We need a connection(This is called Linked Service)]-> ADF-> Destination

b)DataSets- It is actual data that we need to pick, fetch or store. 
Datasets identify data within different data stores, such as tables, files, folders, and documents
Source(sql) (WE have multiple tables, To identify the table (data) which is to be migrated)-> ADF-> Destination

